
====== Q1-a 完整 docstring（看 priority 是否被文档化） ======
Wrapper around a NPU stream.

    A NPU stream is a linear sequence of execution that belongs to a specific
    device, independent from other streams.  See :ref:`npu-semantics` for
    details.

    Arguments:
        device(torch.device or int, optional): a device on which to allocate
            the stream. If :attr:`device` is ``None`` (default) or a negative
            integer, this will use the current device.
        priority(int, optional): priority of the stream. Lower numbers
                                 represent higher priorities.
    
...
含 'priority' 字样: True

====== Q1-b pyACL 的流创建入口与属性常量 ======
create_stream 签名           : 取不到 ValueError
  create_stream_with_config    doc: create stream with config
  get_stream_attribute         doc: get stream attribute
  set_stream_attribute         doc: set stream attribute
  get_stream_available_num     doc: get stream available num
  get_stream_res_limit         doc: get stream res limit
  set_stream_res_limit         doc: set stream res limit
  reset_stream_res_limit       doc: reset stream res limit
  acl 里 STREAM/PRIOR/ATTR 常量: []

